<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 75 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 75 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 75 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates were unchanged and bids in million dirhams accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	BID	 AMOUNT	 INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    15 years	 75	   75	    10.50 percent</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	    75	   75</p>
<p>The bank said the maturity date was set at the year 2011.</p>
<p>The next auction will take place on November 26, it added.</p>
<p>($1= 8.6 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
